      "rule_key": "unguarded_none_attribute",
      "title": "charge() dereferences a None currency when the account has no default",
      "body_markdown": "`charge()` now takes the settlement currency from `account.default_currency` (line 39), which is `None` for every account created before the account-settings page. On that path lines 40-42 return `None` from a function annotated `-> Charge`, and `create_order()` in `app/api/checkout.py` reads `result.id` on the next line. At base the currency came from `account.currency`, which signup always sets.",
